854
00:55:29.083 --> 00:55:31.632
They don't know...
they don't care...

855
00:55:31.708 --> 00:55:34.427
That hearts can break
with words they say...

856
00:55:34.500 --> 00:55:37.049
Like asking for comfort from fire...
Or fire from ice..

857
00:55:37.125 --> 00:55:39.548
