God! What an awful red dog...
Just leave it...

1504
01:48:21.083 --> 01:48:23.302
Kamaljit... What a surprise!

1505
01:48:23.375 --> 01:48:26.879
Oh Samarjit... So
nice to see you here...

1506
01:48:26.958 --> 01:48:29.632
