York we had to meet here...

1507
01:48:29.708 --> 01:48:32.757
Coincidence...
coincidence... Just a coincidence...

1508
01:48:32.833 --> 01:48:33.925
How are you?

1509
01:48:34.833 --> 01:48:36.551
By the way what are you doing here?

1510
01:48:36.625 --> 01:48:39.708
