1523
01:49:23.250 --> 01:49:24.627
OK I'm getting late...
I have to go...

1524
01:49:24.708 --> 01:49:26.756
- Where are you heading?
- Work... 55th and 5th...

1525
01:49:26.833 --> 01:49:28.835
- Oh great... I'll walk you... Alright...
- Sure...

1526
01:49:29.083 --> 01:49:31.802
Sam... I think it worked...

1527
01:49:36.083 --> 01:49:38.711
