That likes no one...

1539
01:50:06.000 --> 01:50:08.799
Not even us... I mean look at us...

1540
01:50:08.875 --> 01:50:10.798
You are super sexy...
I'm a super stud...

1541
01:50:10.875 --> 01:50:13.253
