then show me a sign...

1587
01:52:25.542 --> 01:52:27.840
Just a sign...

1588
01:52:28.750 --> 01:52:33.256
Come on let's make
this work... I love you...

1589
01:52:35.417 --> 01:52:36.509
See you later...

1590
01:52:36.583 --> 01:52:37.709
