That's sweet!

1597
01:55:20.125 --> 01:55:22.799
Ya. I'll see you later at home...

1598
01:55:24.125 --> 01:55:25.877
Yeah... Bye...

1599
01:56:37.708 --> 01:56:39.676
Flowers have their own language...

1600
