the No.1 magazine...

1744
02:09:19.417 --> 02:09:22.091
OK girls from now on
we have a new policy...

1745
02:09:22.167 --> 02:09:24.841
No more late nights... no
more ignoring your husbands...

1746
02:09:24.917 --> 02:09:28.126
